<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Porgera partners reviewing design, strategies.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Porgera partners reviewing design, strategies.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Porgera joint venture partners said on Thursday it was undertaking a complete review of pit design and mining strategies for the Porgera gold mine in Papua New Guinea.</p>
</text>
